### ============================================================================
### KawalWarga REST API v1 — Smoke Test (VS Code REST Client / Thunder Client)
### ============================================================================
### Petunjuk penggunaan:
### 1. Jalankan backend: `php artisan migrate:fresh --seed && php artisan serve`
### 2. Jalankan request secara berurutan dari atas ke bawah.
### 3. Variabel `@token` otomatis mengambil token dari response `@name loginAdmin`
###    atau bisa diisi manual pada baris variabel di bawah.
### ============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api/v1
@healthKey = dev-health-secret
@ticketId = ADU-204
@adminToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.data.token}}
@officerToken = {{loginOfficer.response.body.data.token}}
@token = {{adminToken}}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 0. Health Check & Koneksi AI
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 0.1 Health Check Database & App
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### 0.2 Health Check Gemini AI (memerlukan header X-Health-Key)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ai
Accept: application/json
X-Health-Key: {{healthKey}}


### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. Autentikasi (Login Admin, Login Petugas, Profil Saya)
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 1.1 Login sebagai Admin Verifikator (Nadia Putri)
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@kawalwarga.test",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 1.2 Login sebagai Petugas Lapangan (Budi Santoso)
# @name loginOfficer
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "budi@kawalwarga.test",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 1.3 Cek Profil Pengguna yang Sedang Login (GET /auth/me)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. Alur Warga: Kirim Laporan Baru & Lacak StatusAwal
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 2.1 Kirim Laporan Baru (POST /reports — multipart/form-data)
# @name submitReport
POST {{baseUrl}}/reports
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----KawalWargaBoundary

------KawalWargaBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

Ada lubang jalan cukup dalam di depan Jl. Melati No. 12. Saat turun hujan lubang tertutup genangan air dan membahayakan pengendara sepeda motor.
------KawalWargaBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="latitude"

-6.2088
------KawalWargaBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="longitude"

106.8456
------KawalWargaBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="address_text"

Jl. Melati No. 12, Kel. Sukamaju, Kota Harmoni
------KawalWargaBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="reporter_phone"

081234567890
------KawalWargaBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="photo"; filename="laporan-jalan.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./seeders/placeholder.jpg
------KawalWargaBoundary--

### 2.2 Lacak Tiket Publik (GET /reports/track/{ticket_id}) — Status Menunggu Verifikasi
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/track/{{ticketId}}
Accept: application/json

### 2.3 Lacak Tiket Publik dengan Format Input Tidak Baku (#adu-204)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/track/%23adu-204
Accept: application/json


### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. Alur Admin: Daftar Laporan, Detail, Re-Analyze AI, Approve & Reject
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 3.1 Daftar Laporan Admin — Antrean Verifikasi & Filter
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/reports?status=menunggu_verifikasi&sort=newest&page=1&per_page=8
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3.2 Cari Laporan Admin berdasarkan ID Tiket
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/reports?search=%23adu-204
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3.3 Detail Laporan Lengkap untuk Admin (termasuk hasil AI & duplikat)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/reports/{{ticketId}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3.4 Analisis Ulang Laporan dengan Gemini AI [P2]
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/reports/{{ticketId}}/reanalyze
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3.5 Setujui Laporan (Approve: menunggu_verifikasi -> menunggu_penanganan)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/reports/{{ticketId}}/approve
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "category": "jalan_rusak",
  "urgency": "darurat",
  "note": "Kerusakan mengganggu akses kendaraan. Amankan area terlebih dahulu, lalu periksa kedalaman lubang."
}

### 3.6 Tolak Laporan (Reject: contoh pada tiket menunggu_verifikasi lain)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/reports/ADU-203/reject
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "reason": "Lokasi kejadian berada di luar wilayah layanan instansi."
}


### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. Alur Petugas: Antrean Siap Ditangani, Ambil, Progres, Selesaikan
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 4.1 Antrean Laporan Siap Ditangani (GET /officer/queue)
GET {{baseUrl}}/officer/queue?sort=urgency&page=1&per_page=6
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{officerToken}}

### 4.2 Detail Laporan untuk Petugas (tanpa data AI & nomor pelapor)
GET {{baseUrl}}/officer/reports/{{ticketId}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{officerToken}}

### 4.3 Ambil Laporan (Take: menunggu_penanganan -> diproses)
POST {{baseUrl}}/officer/reports/{{ticketId}}/take
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{officerToken}}

### 4.4 Daftar Tugas Saya (GET /officer/my-reports?status=diproses)
GET {{baseUrl}}/officer/my-reports?status=diproses&page=1&per_page=6
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{officerToken}}

### 4.5 Tambah Catatan Pembaruan Progres Petugas [P2]
POST {{baseUrl}}/officer/reports/{{ticketId}}/progress
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{officerToken}}

{
  "note": "Kami sedang memeriksa kedalaman lubang dan menyiapkan material untuk perbaikan. Area telah diberi tanda pengaman sementara."
}

### 4.6 Lacak Tiket Publik Saat Sedang Diproses (Menampilkan Kabar Terbaru Petugas)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/track/{{ticketId}}
Accept: application/json

### 4.7 Selesaikan Laporan (Complete: diproses -> selesai dengan foto bukti)
POST {{baseUrl}}/officer/reports/{{ticketId}}/complete
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{officerToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----KawalWargaCompleteBoundary

------KawalWargaCompleteBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="notes"

Lubang jalan sudah ditambal dengan aspal dingin dan dipadatkan hingga rata serta aman dilalui kendaraan.
------KawalWargaCompleteBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="photo"; filename="bukti-selesai.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./seeders/placeholder.jpg
------KawalWargaCompleteBoundary--

### 4.8 Lacak Tiket Publik Setelah Selesai (Menampilkan Foto Sebelum & Sesudah)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/track/{{ticketId}}
Accept: application/json


### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. Dashboard Admin: Ringkasan, Peta Persebaran, Ringkasan Eksekutif AI
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 5.1 Dashboard Ringkasan Statistik (GET /admin/dashboard/summary)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/dashboard/summary
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5.2 Dashboard Peta Persebaran Laporan Terverifikasi (GET /admin/dashboard/map)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/dashboard/map
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5.3 Dashboard Ringkasan Eksekutif AI — Cache 6 Jam [P2]
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/dashboard/ai-insight
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5.4 Regenerate Ringkasan Eksekutif AI [P2]
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/dashboard/ai-insight/regenerate
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{}


### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. Chatbot AI Publik (Cek Tiket, Lupa ID Tiket, Panduan Layanan) [P2]
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 6.1 Chatbot — Cek Status Tiket Berdasarkan Nomor Tiket
POST {{baseUrl}}/chatbot
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Halo, bagaimana perkembangan laporan saya #ADU-204?",
  "history": [
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Halo! Kirim ID tiket untuk mengecek laporan Anda."
    }
  ]
}

### 6.2 Chatbot — Fitur Lupa ID Tiket (Cari lewat Nomor WhatsApp)
POST {{baseUrl}}/chatbot
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Saya lupa nomor tiket saya, waktu melapor pakai nomor WA 081299990204",
  "history": []
}

### 6.3 Chatbot — Tanya Panduan Cara Melapor
POST {{baseUrl}}/chatbot
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Bagaimana cara melapor jalan rusak di KawalWarga?",
  "history": []
}


### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 7. Logout
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 7.1 Logout Petugas
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{officerToken}}

### 7.2 Logout Admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
